  "pli-tv-pvr19:25.1": "Bhikkhunovādakavaggasmiṃ, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr19:25.2": "pācittiyena dukkaṭā; ",
  "pli-tv-pvr19:25.3": "Katettha navakā vuttā, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr19:25.4": "katinaṃ cīvarena ca. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr19:26.1": "Bhikkhunovādakavaggasmiṃ, ",
