  "pli-tv-pvr19:108.3": "Vinayaṃ paṭijānantassa, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr19:108.4": "vinayāni suṇohi me. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr19:109.1": "Yāva supucchitaṃ tayā, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr19:109.2": "yāva suvissajjitaṃ mayā; ",
  "pli-tv-pvr19:109.3": "Pucchāvissajjanāya vā, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr19:109.4": "natthi kiñci asuttakanti. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr19:110.1": "Dutiyagāthāsaṅgaṇikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ. "
